model sweep_forms
  tally 2
  on 2026-06-30
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  note "T, M2 C2, #164's forms (the 2.1.7 engine review's): a month-stepped range from the 29th, 30th and 31st as an ask's binding (l29, l30, l31, n31) and as an input's key (dk, k30, kfeb); R1, argmin whose ties by term is a hole on a candidate not tied (am_untied) and on a tied one (am_tied); next(K, d) over an uncertain kind's movement, without and with uncertain (nx, nx_unc)"

source s "synthetic"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

kind maybe: transfers uncertain

index ks = [a, b, c]

place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..

input c1[k in ks]: num

input c2[k in ks]: num

input h[k in ks]: num

input d1: date

input d2: date

input a1: money PLN

input a2: money PLN

input dk[d in 2026-01-30 .. 2026-06-30 step 1 month]: int

move m1: maybe
  on d1
  leg cash from world to konto amount a1

move m2: transfers
  on d2
  leg cash from world to konto amount a2

ask l29: d for d in 2026-01-29 .. 2026-05-31 step 1 month

ask l30: d for d in 2026-01-30 .. 2026-05-31 step 1 month

ask l31: d for d in 2026-01-31 .. 2026-06-30 step 1 month

ask n31: count(d in 2026-01-31 .. 2026-12-31 step 1 month)

ask k30: dk[d] for d in 2026-01-30 .. 2026-06-30 step 1 month

ask kfeb: dk[2026-02-28]

ask am_untied: argmin(c1[k] for k in ks) ties by h[k]

ask am_tied: argmin(c2[k] for k in ks) ties by h[k]

ask nx: next(transfers, 2026-03-01).cash.amount

ask nx_unc: next(transfers, 2026-03-01).cash.amount with uncertain

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  c1[a] = 3 "s"
  c1[b] = 1 "s"
  c1[c] = 2 "s"
  c2[a] = 1 "s"
  c2[b] = 2 "s"
  c2[c] = 1 "s"
  h[a] = 1 "s"
  h[b] = 2 "s"
  d1 = 2026-03-10 "s"
  d2 = 2026-03-20 "s"
  a1 = 7.00 PLN "s"
  a2 = 9.00 PLN "s"
  dk[2026-01-30] = 1 "s"
  dk[2026-02-28] = 2 "s"
  dk[2026-03-30] = 3 "s"
  opening[konto] = 0.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"
